            "question": "How does D-LOCK help keep the box in place?",
            "answer": "The pouch holds the cricket box in place, while the cross-lock straps provide extra support. This setup helps limit unwanted movement while you are playing."
          }
        },
        "question_fHerwh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is D-LOCK protective equipment?",
            "answer": "No. D-LOCK is designed to hold a compatible protective cricket box secured with adjustable straps. We do not make any performance or safety claims."
          }
        },
        "question_mghFkN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I wear D-LOCK for long matches and training sessions?",
            "answer": "Yes. D-LOCK is made for long hours of cricket, regular movement, practice sessions, and matches, with a focus on comfort and support throughout the game."
          }
        },
        "question_4RqdEi": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I wash D-LOCK?",
            "answer": "Remove the box first. Machine wash on a gentle cycle in cold water. Avoid bleach and fabric softener. Tumble dry on low or hang dry for better care. Do not iron."
          }
        },
        "question_mrkzNV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose my size?",
            "answer": "Refer to the 2INTO9 size guide and select the size that best matches your measurements. If your measurements fall between two sizes, we recommend sizing up."
          }
        }
      },
